{"id":"623986","name":"凉拌小头蒜","author":"Satisfy_3IRU","authorId":"12910491","desc":"","cover":"images/623986/cover.jpeg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"小头蒜","amount":"1盘"}],"sub":[{"name":"彩椒","amount":"2个"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"1根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"小头蒜、黄瓜、彩椒洗净备用。","img":"images/623986/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"小头蒜撒1勺盐抓拌均盐5分钟。","img":"images/623986/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将黄瓜、彩椒切丝备用。","img":"images/623986/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"调料汁，1勺生抽。","img":"images/623986/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"勺盐。","img":"images/623986/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"勺白糖。","img":"images/623986/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"勺鸡精。","img":"images/623986/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"勺辣酱。","img":"images/623986/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"勺辣椒油。","img":"images/623986/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"勺核桃油。","img":"images/623986/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"最后倒入2勺白芝麻，搅拌均匀备用。","img":"images/623986/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"盐好的小头蒜用清水洗2遍捞出。","img":"images/623986/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"捞出的小头蒜和黄瓜丝、彩椒丝放在一起。","img":"images/623986/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"把刚刚调好的料汁倒入盘中抓拌均匀。","img":"images/623986/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"装盘即可。","img":"images/623986/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}